    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d179-a3">

                <pb facs="0325" n="319" xml:id="pg319"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Annex No</hi>. 1.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-12-27">December 27, 1900</date>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">IMPERIAL EDICT of the 27th December,
                        1900</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">translation</hi>).</p>
                <p rendition="#center">[Seal of the Emperor.]</p>
                <p>The 6th day of the 11th moon of the 26th year of Kuang-hsü (27 December, 1900),
                    the following Edict was rendered:</p>
                <p>“We have taken cognizance of the whole telegram of Yi-K’uang and Li Hung-chang.
                    It is proper that We accept in their entirety the twelve articles which they
                    have submitted to us.”</p>
                <p>Respect this!</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#italic">Correct copy</hi>. <lb/><signed><list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. d’Anthouard</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">B. Kroupensky.</hi></item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reginald Tower</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">G. Bohlen-Halbach</hi>.</item>
                        </list></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
